      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Statistic book of forest outside stated owned forest for Kalimantan was published. UNDP contributed to the publishing the book. The availability of the statistic book has allowed the district governments revisited their spatial planning for better land use arrangement. Village pilots implemented direct incentives in a form of producing immune boosters to be distributed free to medical staffs during COVID-19 pandemic. UNDP contributed to the COVID-19 actions on the field. Ecological Fiscal Transfer mechanism is in ongoing development the ecological fiscal transfer mechanism. UNDP has contributed to the raise of green incentives mechanism to local government to save 197,000 Hectares forest.</narrative>
